{
  "id": 8860456517831,
  "title": "Personalized Books in Bun Girl Reading on Antique Books Throw Blanket",
  "handle": "personalized-books-in-bun-girl-reading-on-antique-books-throw-blanket",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in comfort with this cozy and personalized blanket, designed especially for book lovers. This unique throw from Jeminise is the perfect way to celebrate your passion for reading or to give as a thoughtful gift to a fellow book enthusiast.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> A thoughtful and personal present that any book lover will cherish, highlighting their love for reading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Make it uniquely yours by adding personal touches such as skin color, hairstyle, and name for a one-of-a-kind blanket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) for the perfect fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> Ideal for special occasions like birthdays, Christmas, or as a heartfelt surprise for a reader.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort and Style:</strong> A beautifully designed, personalized blanket that brings warmth and a stylish touch to any reading nook.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from durable Polyester with a lightweight feel, perfect for year-round comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This blanket is machine washable for convenient and simple cleaning.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Book Lover Blanket 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Book</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>40x30, 50x40, 60x50, 80x60 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<th>Age Range Description</th>\n<td>Adult</td>\n</table>",
